---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="wrap foot__inner">
    <p class="foot__line reveal">
      صُنع خصيصاً لرغد، لأن بعض الناس يحتاجون تذكيراً
      <span class="foot__em">أكثر من مرة</span> 😂
    </p>

    <p class="foot__brand reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
      <button class="foot__pill" type="button" data-foot-egg aria-label="حبة دواء صغيرة">💊</button>
      <span>Reminder System — Raghd Edition</span>
    </p>

    <p class="foot__meta reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 140ms">
      <span class="tnum">{year}</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span>لا يوجد سيرفر، لا يوجد حساب، لا يوجد مهرب.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .foot {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 1.5rem + 3vw, 4.5rem) clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2vw, 3rem);
    border-block-start: 1px solid rgba(23, 18, 56, .08);
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, .5));
  }

  .foot__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .foot__line {
    max-width: 34ch;
    font-size: var(--t-lead);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }
  .foot__em {
    background: linear-gradient(transparent 62%, var(--c-pink-wash) 62%);
    padding-inline: .1em;
  }

  .foot__brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .55rem;
    padding: .5rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .7);
    border: 1px solid rgba(23, 18, 56, .07);
    box-shadow: var(--sh-sm);
    font-size: var(--t-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--c-ink-soft);
    direction: ltr;
  }

  .foot__pill {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: transform var(--d-fast) var(--e-back);
  }
  .foot__pill:hover  { transform: rotate(18deg) scale(1.2); }
  .foot__pill:active { transform: scale(.85); }

  .foot__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: .5rem;
    font-size: var(--t-xs);
    color: var(--c-ink-faint);
  }
</style>
